WEBVTT

00:06:29.236 --> 00:06:33.635
dukej se kishte probleme me obezitetin.

00:06:33.635 --> 00:06:35.811
Arrita ne perfundimin

00:06:35.811 --> 00:06:39.669
se ne kishim krijuar nje standard te larte jetese

00:06:39.669 --> 00:06:43.089
per makinat.

00:06:43.089 --> 00:06:46.324
(te qeshura)

00:06:46.324 --> 00:06:49.864
Por nese ti ishe njeri,

00:06:49.864 --> 00:06:54.433
duhej te luftoje me makinat pothuajse ne cdo cep.

00:06:54.433 --> 00:06:56.706
Qyteti yne eshte shume i gjere.

00:06:56.706 --> 00:07:00.261
Kemi shume kryqezime autostradash.